           bundled deps (libcurl, flatbuffers, etc.).  The objects
           ARE debug-compiled, the PDBs just weren't published.
           Suppress LNK4099 so the build output stays readable. -->
      <AdditionalOptions>%(AdditionalOptions) /ignore:4099</AdditionalOptions>
    </Link>
  </ItemDefinitionGroup>
